Package: yoriito-vss
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Yoriito VSS JSON/CSV data based on COVESA VSS v5.0
 Installs the Yoriito Vehicle Signal Specification data derived from the
 COVESA VSS v5.0 release. The JSON model is installed to
 /etc/yoriito/viss/vss.json and the CSV catalogue to /usr/share/yoriito.
